---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="bio MPA — Relement">
  <article class="py-[var(--space-2xl)]">
    <p class="text-fs--1 text-muted mb-[var(--space-s)]">Products</p>
    <h1
      class="text-fs-2 font-display font-medium text-foreground mb-[var(--space-m)] leading-tight"
    >
      bio MPA
    </h1>
    <div
      class="text-fs-0 text-foreground max-w-2xl space-y-[var(--space-s)] mb-[var(--space-l)]"
    >
      <p>
        bio MPA (3-methylphthalic anhydride) has a uniquely situated methyl
        group and is only accessible from non-edible biomass sources.
      </p>
      <p>
        In May 2023 Relement finalised a successful pilot plant run at the
        multipurpose pilot plant of Solvay in Lyon (now Syensqo). In December
        2024 Relement contracted Allessa GmbH in Frankfurt to start industrial
        production. Samples and industrial ton-scale volumes can be requested.
      </p>
      <p>
        By testing biobased aromatics in various products, Relement continuously
        discovers benefits over fossil-based aromatics — together with customers
        and in-house.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2
      class="text-fs-1 font-display font-medium text-foreground mb-[var(--space-s)]"
    >
      Showcase: bio MPA in alkyd coating
    </h2>
    <p class="text-fs-0 text-foreground max-w-2xl mb-[var(--space-l)]">
      Relement has investigated the benefits of using bio MPA in alkyd coating —
      improved performance while reducing reliance on fossil resources.
    </p>

    <ul
      class="text-fs--1 text-muted space-y-[var(--space-2xs)] mb-[var(--space-xl)] max-w-2xl"
    >
      <li>
        <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Application:</span> coatings,
        resins, materials
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Status:</span> industrial
        production contracted
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Availability:</span> samples &amp;
        ton-scale volumes
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-[var(--space-m)]">
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="text-fs--1 font-medium text-foreground border-b border-foreground hover:opacity-80"
      >
        Sample request →
      </a>
      <a
        href="/products"
        class="text-fs--1 font-medium text-muted border-b border-border hover:opacity-80"
      >
        All products
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
